  "description": "<p>This task is to remove the leaked JCR details exposed when GETting a tombstone.<br/>\nTo reproduce:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>curl -XPUT localhost:8080/rest/collection</li>\n\t<li>curl -XDELETE localhost:8080/rest/collection</li>\n\t<li>curl -XGET localhost:8080/rest/collection<br/>\n&#8212;<br/>\nDiscovered tombstone resource at /collection \n{jcr:createdBy=bypassAdmin, jcr:primaryType=fedora:Tombstone, jcr:created=2016-04-17T12:45:49.151-04:00}\n<p>&#8212;</p></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>As a follow-on ticket, an HTML UI view for tombstones should be created.</p>",
